"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Lipheo tsa lebelo, likopano ka torrent, li-slots tsa ho kenya le li-seeding li hlophisitsoe bakeng sa torrent e ngoe le e ngoe ha u e eketsa, kapa ka mor'a moo ka tlase ho Litlhophiso tsa Torrent. Li-torrents li sebelisa proxy ho tloha tab ea Khoasolla (HTTP kapa SOCKS5, kapa Mac's proxy le \"Use the system settings\") le lipheo tsa lebelo bakeng sa li-downloads tsohle. Liphetoho li sebetsa ho torrents tse qalang ka mor'a moo. Li-peer le li-trackers li ka bona aterese ea hau ea IP, kapa ea proxy ea hau.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Litlhophiso tse sebelisetsoang ho kenya ka ho feletseng ho tsoa webosaeteng. Webosaeteng e na le li-subdomains tsa eona (example.com e na le www.example.com). Li-logins li romelloa feela ho webosaeteng eo'me li bolokiloe le li-secrets tse ling tsa k'homphieutha.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Li-backup li na le likhetho tsa hau, likhetho tsa sebaka, li-queues le lethathamo la ho jarolla. Li-passwords le li-cookies ha lia kenngoa ka har'a li-backup.";
"When you copy a link that ends in one of these types, the Add window opens with it." = "Ha u kopitsa sehokela se felang ka e 'ngoe ea li-types tsena, fensetere ea Ho eketsa e tla bula le eona.";
"Expected checksums are checked automatically when a download finishes. Queues can also quit the app, sleep or shut down the Mac when they are done (Scheduler)." = "Checksums e lebelloang e tla hlahlojoa ka ho toba ha ho kenya e fela. Likoloi li ka tsoa hape ho k'homphieutha, ho robala kapa ho koala Mac ha li felile (Sheduler).";
